/* @catalog — generated by `npm run catalog:generate`; do not edit by hand.
 * Internal
 *   Types: CarouselGeometryOptions
 *   Functions: render, configureCarouselGeometry, requestCarouselRemeasure, albumResponse,
 *              renderAlbumCardRoute, activateAlbumPlay
 *   Constants: artist, album, audioTrack, signedInSession
 * Tests
 *   - Artwork exposes an accessible fallback after image failure
 *   - Artwork keeps the managed original while exposing responsive candidates and priority hints
 *   - Artwork retries the managed original before showing a fallback
 *   - Artwork leaves non-managed sources unchanged without a derived srcset
 *   - standalone cards describe Grid artwork, single-column only below a 304 px content width
 *   - cards link artist and album details while tracks dispatch onPlay
 *   - Album cards offer a separate Play that starts the Album queue without leaving the page
 *   - a signed-in Album card Play records only the Album, and a signed-out one records nothing
 *   - Album card Play announces an empty or unavailable Album and leaves playback untouched
 *   - an offline Album card Play fails at once instead of starting playback when the network returns
 *   - Album card Play explains a refusal from listening-room playback
 *   - the playing MediaTrack card offers Pause and pauses without relaunching
 *   - shows only the available carousel directions as overflow moves between edges
 *   - uses stable page and boundary commands without intercepting keys from cards
 *   - uses immediate carousel scrolling when reduced motion is requested
 *   - recalculates carousel overflow with ResizeObserver and item-count changes
 *   - section presentations describe the rendered card and list artwork widths
 *   - room actions are separate from catalog playback and excluded for Video and unavailable Library rows
 *   - a disabled social rollout offers no Share or Listen together action on cards or rows
 *   - social without rooms keeps Share but hides Listen together
 *   - a rollout change while open removes card social actions without reloading the page
 *   - enabling the rollout while open loads the deferred social actions
 * @end-catalog */

